old your planet and defeat the creeping, plotting enemy?\nPlay today and find out what the word INVASIVE truly stands for!\n\nBe proud of your R.O.O.T.S", "summary": "R.O.O.T.S is a real-time strategy game that pits the player against colorful yet invasive enemies that must be overtaken before the player themselves is uprooted! Warfare has never been so beautifully unorthodox.", "themes": [{"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/roots", "videos": [{"id": 85578, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "79PywUMXCIY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=79PywUMXCIY", "title": "The R.O.O.T.S Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/79PywUMXCIY/sddefault.jpg"}]}